# serviceKey와 baseUrl은 http-client.env.json / http-client.private.env.json에서 읽습니다. (README 참고)
@depPlandTime = 20260310

### 항공편 조회 (GET) - 광주 → 제주
GET {{baseUrl}}/GetFlightOpratInfoList?serviceKey={{serviceKey}}&pageNo=1&numOfRows=10&_type=json&depAirportId=NAARKJJ&arrAirportId=NAARKPC&depPlandTime={{depPlandTime}}
Accept: application/json

